# the-ghost-ai-

The landing page for Ghost AI (Ghost OS), from January 24, 2026: one HTML page with a hero video and two explainer images.

Static; open `index.html` in a browser. It was the first public page for the idea that later became [Boxes](https://github.com/CultureReset/Boxes) and NODE. Nothing runs from it.

| File | What it is |
|---|---|
| `index.html` | The landing page |
| `hero-video.mp4` | The hero video |
| `how-ghost-os-works.png`, `ghost-os-feature.png` | Explainer images |
| `favicon.svg` | The icon |
